Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 21:19:34 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 2/6] ASoC: dt-bindings: allwinner,sun4i-a10-codec: add
 allwinner,pa-delay-ms

Document an optional delay, in milliseconds, between enabling the
external speaker amplifier and the speaker being ready. The driver keeps
700 ms when the property is absent.

Draft for the Redux project.

This patch was drafted with an AI coding assistant (Claude).
---
 .../bindings/sound/allwinner,sun4i-a10-codec.yaml          | 7 +++++++
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/allwinner,sun4i-a10-codec.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/allwinner,sun4i-a10-codec.yaml
index b4eca702f..668ac0439 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/allwinner,sun4i-a10-codec.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/allwinner,sun4i-a10-codec.yaml
@@ -102,6 +102,13 @@ properties:
     maxItems: 1
     description: GPIO to enable the external amplifier
 
+  allwinner,pa-delay-ms:
+    description:
+      Time to wait after enabling the external amplifier before audio is
+      expected on the speaker.
+    default: 700
+    maximum: 2000
+
   hp-det-gpios:
     maxItems: 1
     description: GPIO for headphone/line-out detection
